{
  "$comment": [
    "CONFIRMED walk interchanges between DISTINCT stations. Generated from",
    "out/interchange-candidates.json and then decided by hand — the pipeline proposes, a human",
    "disposes, because whether a walk transfer exists and how long it takes are real-world facts.",
    "",
    "Stations are identified by (name, operator). Name alone is ambiguous: 'Lower Parel' and",
    "'Currey Road' form TWO different candidate pairs (Western<->Central, and Central<->Monorail).",
    "",
    "Walk times are DERIVED from the policy below rather than typed in, so they stay consistent.",
    "They are estimates, and deliberately lower-risk than fare estimates: a wrong walk time only",
    "reorders route suggestions, whereas a wrong fare misinforms a purchase. Fare is unaffected —",
    "crossing between operators always restarts that operator's fare regardless of walk time.",
    "",
    "Rejections are recorded with reasons so a future maintainer can see what was considered.",
    "Reviewed 2026-08-06."
  ],
  "policy": {
    "walkSpeedMps": 1.2,
